{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-14-1","title":"Revelation 14:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The Lamb standing on mount Sion with his company. 6 An angel preaches the gospel. 8 The fall of Babylon. 15 The harvest of the world. 20 The winepress of the wrath of God.</p>\n<p>I looked. 14; 4:1; 6:8; 15:5; Jer 1:11; Eze 1:4; 2:9; 8:7; 10:1,9; 44:4; Da 12:5 Am 8:2; Zec 4:2 a Lamb. 5:5-9,12,13; 7:9-17 mount. Ps 2:6; 132:13,14; Isa 49:14; Joe 2:32; Mic 4:7; Ro 9:33 Heb 12:22-24 an. 7:4-8 having. 3:12; 7:3; 13:16,17; Lu 12:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-2","title":"Revelation 14:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>a voice. 10:4; 11:12,15; 19:1-7 of many. 1:15; 19:6; Ps 93:4; Isa 17:13; Eze 43:2 of a. 1:10; 8:7-13; 9:1; 10:3,4; 11:15; Ex 19:16; 20:18; Zec 9:14 harpers. 5:8; 15:2; 18:22; 2Sa 6:5; 1Ch 25:1-7; Ps 33:2; 43:4; 57:8; 92:3 Ps 98:5; 147:7; 149:3; 150:3-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-3","title":"Revelation 14:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>a. 5:9; 15:3; Ps 33:3; 40:3; 96:1; 98:1; 144:9; 149:1; Isa 42:10 throne. 4:2-11 no. 1; 2:17; Ps 25:14; Mt 11:25-27; 1Co 1:18; 2:14 redeemed. 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-4","title":"Revelation 14:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>for. Ps 45:14; So 1:3; 6:8; Mt 25:1; 1Co 7:25,26,28; 2Co 11:2; 1Ti 4:3 which follow. 3:4; 7:15-17; 17:14; Mt 8:19; Lu 9:57-62; Joh 8:12; 10:27; 12:26 Joh 13:37 These were. 5:9 redeemed. Gr. bought. Ps 74:2; Ac 20:28; 1Co 6:20; Eph 1:14; 1Pe 2:9; *marg: the first fruits. Jer 2:3; Am 6:1; *marg: 1Co 16:15; Jas 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-5","title":"Revelation 14:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>in. Ps 32:2; 34:13; 55:11; Pr 8:8; Isa 53:9; Zep 3:13; Mt 12:34; Joh 1:47 1Pe 3:10 without. So 4:7; Da 6:4; Ho 10:2; Lu 23:4; Eph 5:27; Col 1:22; Jude 1:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-6","title":"Revelation 14:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>another. 8:13; Isa 6:2,6,7; Eze 1:14; Da 9:21 in. Ge 1:6 everlasting. 2Sa 23:5; Ps 119:142; 139:24; 145:13; Isa 40:8; 45:17; 51:6,8 Eph 3:9-11; 2Th 2:16; Tit 1:1-3; Heb 13:20 preach. Mt 10:27; Mr 16:15; Ro 16:25; Col 1:23 every. 10:11; 13:7; Da 4:1; 6:25,26; Eph 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-7","title":"Revelation 14:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>with. Isa 40:3,6,9; 44:23; 52:7,8; 58:1; Ho 8:1 Fear. 11:18; 15:4; 19:5; Ge 22:12; Ps 36:1; 89:7; Ec 12:13,14 give. 4:9; 16:9; Jos 7:19; 1Sa 6:5; Isa 42:12; Mal 2:2; Lu 17:18 hour. 11:18; 15:4; 18:10,17,19; Eze 7:2,6; Da 8:19; Mt 25:13; Joh 5:25-29 1Pe 4:7 worship. 4:11; Ex 20:11; Ne 9:6; Ps 33:6; 95:5; 124:8; 146:5,6; Pr 8:22-31 Jer 10:10; Ac 14:15; 17:23-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-8","title":"Revelation 14:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Babylon. 16:19; 17:5,18; 18:2,3,10,11,18-21; Isa 21:9; Jer 51:7,8,64 because. 11:8; 17:2-5; 18:3,10,18,21; 19:2; Jer 51:7; Eze 16:15-22 Na 3:19 wrath. 13:15-17; 17:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-9","title":"Revelation 14:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>the third. 6-8; Jer 44:4 If. 11; 13:3-6,11-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-10","title":"Revelation 14:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>drink. 16:19; 18:3; Job 21:20; Ps 11:6; 60:3; 75:8; Isa 29:9; 51:17,21,22 Jer 25:15-17,27; 51:57 into. 18:6; Ps 73:10; Isa 51:17; Jer 49:12; La 4:21; Hab 2:16; Mt 20:22 Mt 26:39 be. 9:17,18; 19:20; 20:10; 21:8; Ge 19:24; De 29:23; Job 18:15; Ps 11:6 Isa 30:33; 34:9; Mt 25:41; Jude 1:7 in the. Ps 37:34; 52:6; 91:8; Eze 20:48; Mt 13:41,42,49,50; 2Th 1:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-11","title":"Revelation 14:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>smoke. 18:18; 19:3; Ge 19:28; Isa 33:14; 34:10; Joe 2:30; Lu 16:23 for. 4:9,10; 5:13,14; 7:12; 11:15; 20:10; 22:5; Ex 15:18; Ps 10:16; 145:1 Mt 25:41,46; Heb 1:8 no. De 28:65; Isa 57:20; Mt 11:28; Mr 9:43-49; Lu 16:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-12","title":"Revelation 14:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>is. 13:10 here are. 12:17 the faith. 3:8,10; 2Ti 4:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-13","title":"Revelation 14:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>a voice. 11:15,19; 16:17; Mt 3:17 Write. 1:11; 2:1; 10:4; 19:9; 21:5 Blessed. 20:6; Ec 4:1,2; Isa 57:1,2; 2Co 5:8; Php 1:21-23 die. Ro 14:8; 1Co 15:18; 1Th 4:14,16; 5:10 from henceforth: Yea saith the Spirit. or, from henceforthsaith the Spirit, Yea. rest. 6:11; 7:14-17; Job 3:17-19; Isa 35:10; 57:2; Lu 16:25; 2Th 1:6,7 Heb 4:9-11 and their. Ps 19:11; 85:13; Mt 25:35-40; Lu 16:9; 1Co 15:58; Ga 6:7,8; Php 2:17 2Ti 4:7,8; Heb 6:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-14","title":"Revelation 14:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>behold. 15,16; 1:7; 10:1; 20:11; Ps 97:2; Isa 19:1; Mt 17:5; Lu 21:27 like. 1:13; Eze 1:26; Da 7:13 a golden. 6:2; 11:17; 19:12; Ps 21:3; Heb 2:9 a sharp. 15-17; Joe 3:12,13; Mt 13:30; Mr 4:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-15","title":"Revelation 14:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>came. 16:17 crying. 6:10; Isa 62:1,6,7 Thrust. 14 harvest. 13:12; Jer 51:33; Joe 3:13; Mt 13:30,39 ripe. or, dried. 18; Ge 15:6; Zec 5:6-11; Mt 23:32; 1Th 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-16","title":"Revelation 14:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>he. 14; Mt 16:27; Joh 5:22,23 thrust. 19; 16:1-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-17","title":"Revelation 14:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>came. 14,15,18; 15:5,6; 16:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-18","title":"Revelation 14:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>came. 6:9,10 which. 16:8 and cried. 15,16 Thrust. Joe 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-19","title":"Revelation 14:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>and cast. 19:15-21; De 32:32,33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-14-20","title":"Revelation 14:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>the winepress. Isa 63:1-3; La 1:15 without. 11:8; Heb 13:11,12 and blood. 19:14-21; Isa 34:5-7; 66:24; Eze 39:17-21</p>"}]}